sentences.text:
Learned counsel for the applicant submitted that applicant is innocent and has been falsely implicated in the present case due to ulterior motive; the allegation alleged in the F.I.R. is not corroborating with the statement of victim recorded under Sections 161 Cr.P.C. and 164 Cr.P.C.;
medical examination report of the victim is also not supporting the prosecution case; instant F.I.R.
has been lodged only to harass the applicant; the victim was in touch with the applicant since last four years and she enjoyed the company of the applicant without raising any alarm.
